# Learn and research

Unfamiliar tech: search official docs, short research brief (what / pros / cons / pick), then plan if architectural.

“How does X work?” → explain first; implement only if asked.

Non-trivial choices: why, what else existed, where in the repo.

Load `learn-while-building` when the user wants a learning log. “Just do it” → less prose, still commit and report.
